  <h2>Who Uses This <%= page.h1 %> Generator?</h2>

  <h3>Parents and Caregivers</h3>
  <p>The most common use case. Parents come here when their child wants "a unicorn coloring page" or "a dinosaur coloring page" and Pinterest results look bland. Generate one tailored to your kid's specific request in under a minute. Free tier covers most family needs (3 pages per day is plenty for an afternoon activity).</p>

